        "sid": "ZEC 9"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "9",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 9:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wuprofwetu wezu daYehova wakutena ituŋa daHadaraki, nikuwunookelu windi kuDamakasa. Muloŋa mesu awantu nianyichidi yawaIsarela yejima yinatali kudi Yehova. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.9.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.9.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 9:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "NiHamati wakuma kuŋinza yawu; Tira naZidoni, muloŋa yena wasweja maana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.9.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.9.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 9:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tira watuŋili chipaka chindi chakudikaŋila, walumbikili siliva neyi maseki, wuru wawuwahi neyi maseki amunyikwakwa achakata. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.9.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.9.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 9:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tiyenu, Yehova wakamumwaŋa, wakanata Ŋovu jindi mukaluŋalwiji, akamulasha kudi kesi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.9.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.9.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 9:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.9.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.9.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 9:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ashekeloni wakachimona, wakatiya woma; niGaza nawa, chakamukatisha nankashi kumuchima; niEkeroni nawa, muloŋa wakatiya nsonyi mwadiŋi nakutalilayi. Mwanta walukanu wakanoŋeli kuGaza, kuAshekeloni hikwakashakama nawa muntuku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.9.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.9.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 9:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muwanta wamuAshidodi mwakashakama mwana wamuchiputa, aFwilistinu nakayifumisha wanta wawu wadinkawu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.9.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.9.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 9:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nakamufumisha nimashi indi adi mukanwa kindi, niyishimashima yindi yidi kumaji indi; kudi yena kwakashala antu aNzambi yetu, yena wakekala neyi chilolu muYuda, niEkeroni wakekala neyi kaYebusi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.9.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.9.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 9:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Itala dami nakadituŋala chilombu kwi-ndo, kulonda kubuli njita, kulonda kubuli antu kuhitamu hela kufunta. Himwakahita nawa cheŋi mukwakukabisha akwawuku. Muloŋa namoni dehi namesu ami katataka.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.9.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.9.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 9:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.9.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.9.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 9:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eyi mwana kaZiyona wamumbanda, zaŋalalaku chacheni; eyi mwana kaYerusalema wamumbanda, dikuwi. Tala, Mwanta weyi hakwinza kudeyi. Waloŋa, wukweti wamwinu; wadizoza, wudi nakwendela hachimbulu, hamwana kachimbulu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.9.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.9.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 9:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ikalu dakuEfweremi nakadifumishahu, nikawalu kakuYerusalema, niwuta wamukunji wanjita nakayifumishahu; yena wakahosha nanyuza nsaŋu yakuwunda. Wanta windi wakafuma kukaluŋalwiji kamu wushika nikukaluŋalwiji kakwawu, wakafuma kuKaloŋa wushika nikunsa jeseki.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.9.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.9.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 9:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.9.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.9.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 9:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakwila eyi nawa ankoli jeyi nayipulwisha dehi muwina wakadi meji, namashi achitiyaŋenu cheyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.9.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.9.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 9:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enu ankoli jachikuhwelela, balumukenu mutali kuchipaka chakudikaŋila. Hela lelu nidi nakukuleja nami, Nukutkufuntishilamu kayedi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.9.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.9.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 9:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muloŋa nevula dehi Yuda kulonda nisowi, naŋachikŋa dehi Efweremi muwuta; eyi Ziyona, nukusaŋumuna anyaneyi adasi nanyana keyeyi Heleni, nukukubalumuna kwikala neyi mpoku yakabali yachilobu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.9.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.9.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 9:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akamumona Yehova hewulu dawu, nsewu yindi yidi nakuya neyi nzaji. Mwanta Yehova wakemba mpùŋa, wakaya nayinjimbi yakukabeta kakuchidiilu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.9.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.9.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 9:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehova wamazaza wakayilwila; akavwota, akadatola malola akwasa nachu nanyonji; akanwa, akabobola neyi antu anwaŋa vinyu. Akenzala neyi yikashi, akazowa neyi kumawombu atumeŋa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.9.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.9.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 9:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.9.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.9.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 9:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hefuku odu Yehova Nzambi yawu wakayamwina neyi mukanka wanyikoku, wowu antu indi. Akekala neyi tumalola twakuchibaŋula tukukejima hewulu detuŋa dindi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.9.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.9.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 9:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuwaha kwindi o chikwasweja! Lubanji lwindi chilwasweja! Kudya kwakaluŋisha anyikwenzi, nivinyu yayiha yakaluŋisha yaloŋadima yawambanda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.9.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.9.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
